cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work in research, please cite it and Craftax (see references)."
title: "wut_murl_craftax: Textbook reinforcement learning on Craftax"
abstract: >-
  Course project for Mathematical Underpinning of Reinforcement Learning (MURL) at the
  Warsaw University of Technology: three published agents and four textbook-level methods
  trained on Craftax, compared on score, learning stability, hardware use and in-game
  behaviour, with distilled decision rules and videos of the learning process.
type: software
